title Cassette with no take at all (an empty recordings list): the BLANK cassette is in the deck from the first frame: body, window, still hubs, SIDE A and the format, no handwriting on the label
sizes 480x320 320x480 640x480
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO notakes
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 500
expect notext "OPEN"
expect notext "Take 0"
@480x320 expect text "TAKE 008 · 48k/16 WAV · 12 h 40 left"
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
shot blank-idle
expect noquit
